{
  "id": "andritz_spl_diversity_v1",
  "description": "Redundancy-heavy queries where the corpus contains the same (or near-identical) manual indexed under many projects/sections. Passing requires surfacing chunks from DISTINCT documents in the top-k (expected_distinct_documents), which is what the MMR diversity stage provides. Built from verified Qdrant clusters: g150-operating-instructions (13 docs), printable parts manuals (12 docs), LH2 vacuum-set manuals (12 docs), Excelle S5PP6TT carding docs (89 docs), high pressure set (978 docs), operator manual 5186004875 (33 docs), Qualiscan QMS-12 (32 docs), URACA KD724 chapters (378 docs).",
